summary:
  The chosen chime's road disappears — a ringer alarm falls through to
  the station machinery with a sentinel for a URL.

history:
  The listener asked for the chime as a pickable wake sound (2026-08-10)
  and the add form stores the "chime:" sentinel for it. If the fire
  path's dispatch stops recognising the sentinel, the alarm tries to
  play "chime:" as a stream URL: heal roads spin on garbage and the
  morning is carried by the fallback net alone — a silent regression a
  refactor of the dispatch chain could ship without noticing.

target:
  package/contents/ui/AlarmEngine.qml

find:
          if ((a.url || "") === "chime:") { _alarmFireChime(a); return; }

replace:
          if ((a.url || "") === "chime-x:") { _alarmFireChime(a); return; }

expect:
  Killed by tst_alarmengine.qml
  test_the_chime_choice_rides_its_own_road: the fire falls through to
  the station road, startWithFade carries "chime:" instead of the
  bundled tone and the hostname verify goes red.
